<title>UK: Henlys H1 pre-tax profit rises 48.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Henlys H1 pre-tax profit rises 48.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.4		   vs 15.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.0		    vs 4.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     17.1		   vs 11.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   244.0		  vs 228.1</p>
<p> Operating profit	 18.4		   vs 12.2</p>
<p> Interest payable	 1.3		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Tax			  5.8		    vs 3.8</p>
<p> Net taxed		  11.3		   vs 7.7</p>
<p> Transfer to reserves   8.6		    vs 5.6</p>
<p>Pay date		   October 4 1996</p>
<p>Div registration date  September 17 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - Henlys Group Plc is a motor vehicle distributor.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
